Added `__builtin_expect` hints so the common valid-type path is laid out as the fall-through and the profile fallback branches are marked unlikely, preserving exact behavior.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if (__builtin_expect(type != FIT_UINT8_INVALID, 1))
        return type;

    if (__builtin_expect(profile == NULL, 0))
        return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;

    if (__builtin_expect(profileIndex >= profile->numFields, 0))
        return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;

    return profile->fields[profileIndex].type;
}
```